coins, and next-gen financial systems.</p>\n<p>I hold certifications in AI Product Strategy (MIT), Blockchain Technologies (MIT), and Product Management (Product School), and I’ve built and led teams to deliver secure, scalable, and resilient tech in highly regulated environments.</p>\n<p>When I’m not optimizing APIs or mentoring engineers, I enjoy researching disruptive tech, simplifying complexity, and exploring the next wave of digital transformation.</p>\n<p>Here are a few of the things I love doing professionally and personally!</p>"}}]},"jobs":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"QA Director / Engineering Leader (TPM)","company":"TikTok Inc.","location":"Bellevue, WA","range":"Nov 2023 – Present","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Led end-to-end program execution for TikTok Seller, Creator Partner, and Brand Portals, supporting 350K+ weekly active users across US &#x26; UK.</li>\n<li>Oversaw QA for real-time data pipelines (~100TB), ensuring data integrity across online/offline analytics.</li>\n<li>Streamlined Agile delivery for a 40+ person team, increasing productivity by 25% and reducing time to market by 10%.</li>\n<li>Defined OKRs, improved quality metrics, and led test automation to increase test coverage and reduce bugs by 25%.</li>\n<li>Fostered cross-functional alignment with 40+ stakeholders through weekly syncs, reducing feature blockers by 30%.</li>\n<li>Mentored and grew a high-performing team of 9+ engineers, improving delivery velocity by 35%.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Engineering Manager (QA & Data Platforms)","company":"Indeed","location":"Austin, TX","range":"Dec 2022 – Nov 2023","url":"https://www.indeed.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Led collaboration between QA, DevOps, and Data teams to implement push-on-green CI/CD pipelines.</li>\n<li>Reduced manual testing efforts by 50% and accelerated feature rollouts by 30% through automation strategies.</li>\n<li>Aligned testing strategy with business goals, improving release confidence and deployment frequency.</li>\n<li>Streamlined communication across engineering, analytics, and leadership to ensure delivery success.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Staff QA Engineer","company":"Visa Inc.","location":"Austin, TX (Remote & Onsite)","range":"Aug 2018 – Dec 2022","url":"https://www.visa.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Led global deployment of high-accuracy account validation services, handling 1M+ daily requests across 200+ countries with 99.99% accuracy.</li>\n<li>Delivered a robust BIN Lookup service, improving latency by 20% and supporting 50+ global payment partners.</li>\n<li>Migrated APIs from SOAP to JSON, cutting integration errors by 25% across 100+ merchants.</li>\n<li>Spearheaded EMV certification and transaction validation to ensure Google Pay and Apple Pay compliance globally.</li>\n<li>Partnered with DevOps to drive 99.95% deployment success and reduce downtime by 30% in critical releases.</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"QA Lead / Senior QA Engineer (Consultant Roles)","company":"Mastech / TekSystems","location":"Multiple Client Locations (US)","range":"Jan 2015 – Jul 2018","url":"https://www.mastechdigital.com/"},"html":"<ul>\n<li>Delivered end-to-end QA leadership for enterprise clients across FinTech, Healthcare, and Retail domains.</li>\n<li>Led test strategy, automation design, and release quality governance for cross-functional teams.</li>\n<li>Implemented robust API and UI automation frameworks using Selenium, TestNG, and Postman.</li>\n<li>Collaborated with developers, BAs, and business stakeholders to ensure defect-free product delivery.</li>\n<li>Mentored junior QA engineers and standardized test documentation across client accounts.</li>\n</ul>"}}]},"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"BIN Lookup Service","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"tracedSVG":"data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20width='400'%20height='208'%20viewBox='0