iven Decision Making</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Microsoft - Program Management Fundamentals™","tech":null,"github":null,"external":null},"html":"<p>A comprehensive program covering the end-to-end lifecycle of program management. Mastered stakeholder alignment, roadmap planning, risk mitigation, budgeting, OKRs, and executive communication.</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Program Lifecycle · Strategic Execution · OKRs · Budgeting · Risk Management · Retrospectives · Executive Communication · Go-to-Market Planning · Change Management</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"MIT - Designing and Building AI Products and Services™","tech":null,"github":null,"external":null},"html":"<p>Focused on building AI-first products using LLMs, prompt engineering, MLOps, and GenAI tools. Applied AI lifecycle frameworks to real-world product scenarios and learned governance best practices for enterprise-grade solutions.</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> AI Product Lifecycle · LLM Product Strategy · MLOps · Prompt Engineering · Generative AI · AI Governance · Team Leadership</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"MIT - Blockchain: Disruptive Technology™","tech":null,"github":null,"external":null},"html":"<p>Gained hands-on insight into Web3 ecosystems, smart contract design, DApps, tokenomics, and decentralized identity. Explored real-world use cases in stablecoins, CBDCs, and governance frameworks on Ethereum, Solana, and Polygon.</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Web3 Architecture · Smart Contracts · Tokenomics · Blockchain Compliance · Digital Identity · Crypto Payments · Stablecoins · Governance</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Scrum Alliance - Certified ScrumMaster (CSM)™","tech":null,"github":null,"external":null},"html":"<p>Scrum Alliance–certified ScrumMaster with deep understanding of Agile ceremonies, team facilitation, and iterative product development. Applied Scrum principles to drive collaboration, transparency, and predictable delivery in engineering teams.</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Scrum · Agile · Retrospectives · Velocity Tracking · Team Facilitation · Sprint Planning · Servant Leadership</p>"}}]},"contact":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Get In Touch","buttonText":"Mail Me"},"html":"<p>My inbox is always open. Whether you have a question or just want to say hello, I'll try my best to get back to you! Feel free to mail me about any relevant job updates.</p>"}}]}},"pageContext":{}}}